# NOT ignored: dependency-cruiser's known-violations baseline is meant to be
# committed. `depcruise --ignore-known` (both apps' depcruise script) cannot run
# without it, so an ignored baseline makes the dependency gate unrunnable on any
# clean checkout — and `make deps-baseline` is shrink-only, which only means
# anything if the file is shared.
# .dependency-cruiser-known-violations.json